Bewerten Sie jede anwendbare Gefährdung mit Eintrittshäufigkeit und Schadenshöhe
und entscheiden Sie die Anwendbarkeit jeder Gefährdung (Ja/Nein).

<!-- cypro-check (TASK-127): passes when no threat is left "unassessed".
     Unassessed = a threat whose applicability is not "no" (so undecided OR applicable)
     AND that is missing either initial_impact or initial_probability. `has[field]`
     without a suffix tests the field value for non-emptiness (a present-but-empty
     field counts as missing). The set difference removes fully assessed threats and
     `count[]match[0]` passes only when none remain. Blocks the pre-print check, so an
     unassessed/undecided threat prevents printing. -->
